        "params": {
          "text": "**FN03 \u2014 Where does the response come from?**  \n**1 Predict \u2192 2 Run \u2192 3 Inspect \u2192 4 Change one thing.** Run **2 s at 10 Hz**, then open Scope.  \n`y[n]=u[n]+0.5 y[n\u22121]`. Total/natural start with `y[\u22121]=2 V`; forced starts with 0 V.  \nPredict: total = natural + forced at every sample; residual = 0 V.  \nTry: select total_memory, press F4, change initial_value 2 to 0; rerun. Is the residual zero?  \n[Open FN03 student lab](qrc:/s7studio/help/education/labs/FN03-initial-conditions/README.md) \u00b7 [MIT difference equations](https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-003-signals-and-systems-fall-2011/resources/mit6_003f11_chap1/) \u00b7 [MIT modularity](https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-003-signals-and-systems-fall-2011/resources/mit6_003f11_chap2/)",
          "text_format": "markdown",
